        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Reed, Mike Pringle, Johnny Bright\n- Organizations: Canadian Football League, Drake University\n- Events: 54th Grey Cup\n- Topics: CFL history, running backs, college football, MVP awards\n\nFacts:\n- Johnny Bright was born on June 11, 1930, and died on December 14, 1983.\n- Johnny Bright played college football at Drake University.\n- Johnny Bright was a professional Canadian football player in the Canadian Football League.\n- George Reed, Mike Pringle, and Johnny Bright are often mentioned as the greatest running backs in Canadian Football League history.\n- In the 54th Grey Cup, George Reed was the MVP with 31 rushes for 133 yards and one rushing touchdown.",
